  22: the no-`-T` route stops on the zero word (`noT`).  `noT unimpl` (the zero word reported UNIMPLEMENTED, because the read
  23: succeeded) and `noT chkstop` (no checkstop text) are NOT controls: they catch D15 and V7, which send a successful read into the
